                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "ARE YOU SERIOUS? This game is atrociously bad\nI bought the game in a bundle for the easy achievements thinking this would be good like other anime visual novels.\nWhy?\n-Way too short. Most visual novels last longer. You can finish the entire game in like 20-30 minutes.\n-The plot could have been better. There were few seconds of tensions and twists. However, those attempts were medicore at best.\n-The game was so sad, depressing and gloomy unlike other Dharker studio games. The female character is physically abused by gang members. Additionally, the male character is tortured by the doctors. His spine is taken out and constantly beaten, tortured and experimented with. It is like what Josef mengele did to his patients in concentration camps in WW2. \n-Come on Dharker studio games....\n-I don't understand what the point of this was? An introduction to another bad game? Well, Congratulations....you said the bar very low. \nFeel free to disagree I respect your opinion.\nI recommend you play One manga day it is free and the game is much better than this",
